\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 # SGE - Sistema de Gerenciamento de Eventos
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 Este \'e9 o sistema base do SGE, que serve como template para criar novas inst\'e2ncias para cada cliente.\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 ## Estrutura de Pastas
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 ```\cb1 \
\cb3 SGE/\cb1 \
\cb3 \uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  CLIENTES/           # Pasta onde ser\'e3o criadas as inst\'e2ncias de cada cliente\cb1 \
\cb3 \uc0\u9474    \u9492 \u9472 \u9472  [cliente-slug]/ # Uma pasta para cada cliente (criada automaticamente)\cb1 \
\cb3 \uc0\u9474        \u9492 \u9472 \u9472  WebApp/     # Aplica\'e7\'e3o web do cliente\cb1 \
\cb3 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  WebApp/             # Aplica\'e7\'e3o web base (template)\cb1 \
\cb3     \uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  Controllers/    # Controladores da aplica\'e7\'e3o\cb1 \
\cb3     \uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  Models/         # Modelos de dados\cb1 \
\cb3     \uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  ViewModels/     # ViewModels\cb1 \
\cb3     \uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  Views/          # Views da aplica\'e7\'e3o\cb1 \
\cb3     \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  wwwroot/        # Arquivos est\'e1ticos\cb1 \
\cb3 ```\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 ## Como Funciona
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 1.\cf4 \strokec4  Quando um novo cliente \'e9 configurado atrav\'e9s da p\'e1gina \cf6 \strokec6 `/setup`\cf4 \strokec4 :\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Uma nova pasta \'e9 criada em \cf6 \strokec6 `CLIENTES/[nome-do-cliente]`\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Os arquivos necess\'e1rios s\'e3o copiados da pasta \cf6 \strokec6 `WebApp`\cf4 \strokec4  base\cb1 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  As configura\'e7\'f5es espec\'edficas do cliente s\'e3o salvas em seu pr\'f3prio \cf6 \strokec6 `appsettings.json`\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  O logo do cliente \'e9 armazenado em sua pr\'f3pria pasta \cf6 \strokec6 `wwwroot/uploads/logos`\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 2.\cf4 \strokec4  Cada cliente tem sua pr\'f3pria inst\'e2ncia independente do sistema, permitindo:\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Configura\'e7\'f5es personalizadas\cb1 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Temas pr\'f3prios\cb1 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Logos personalizados\cb1 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Base de dados independente\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 ## Configura\'e7\'e3o de Novo Cliente
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 1.\cf4 \strokec4  Execute a aplica\'e7\'e3o base\cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 2.\cf4 \strokec4  Acesse \cf6 \strokec6 `/setup`\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 3.\cf4 \strokec4  Preencha as informa\'e7\'f5es da empresa:\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Nome completo\cb1 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Nome curto (usado para criar a pasta do cliente)\cb1 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Logo\cb1 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Tema\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 4.\cf4 \strokec4  Configure o usu\'e1rio administrador inicial\cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 5.\cf4 \strokec4  O sistema criar\'e1 automaticamente:\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  A pasta do cliente em \cf6 \strokec6 `CLIENTES/[nome-curto]`\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Uma c\'f3pia limpa do sistema\cb1 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  As configura\'e7\'f5es iniciais\cb1 \
\cb3    \cf5 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  O primeiro usu\'e1rio administrador\cb1 \
\
